+# Accounts Service
+
+Language for customer accounts and the staff support workflow.
+
+## Support cases
+
+**Support case**:
+A customer-raised request about an account that is handled by a support user.
+
+**Assignee**:
+The support user currently responsible for handling a support case. An assignee must be assigned to the case's account.
+
+**Support assignment**:
+The tenant-scoped relationship that authorizes a support user to work on an account.
+
