@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+# Case assignees must be account support users
+
+Case reassignment accepts only a support user already assigned to the case's account. This keeps case handling within the account-level support boundary, which the service can validate locally through `support_assignments` even though user identities themselves come from JWTs.
